<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ford cut by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ford cut by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said analyst Mike Ward downgraded Ford Motor Co to neutral from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Wednesday, Ford posted second quarter earnings of $2.06 per diluted share on revenues of $40.3 billion, compared with $1.56 per diluted share on revenues of $39 billion.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Ford dropped 1-3/16 to 40-15/16.</p>
</text>
